# CloudLinux / cPanel Phusion Passenger config for Node.js
# Adjust PassengerAppRoot and PassengerNodejs to your account's paths
# (copy them from cPanel -> Setup Node.js App after creating the app).
PassengerEnabled On
PassengerAppType node
PassengerBaseURI /
PassengerAppRoot /home/USERNAME/domains/sections-apps.clipvaultz.online/public_html
PassengerStartupFile start.cjs
PassengerNodejs /home/USERNAME/nodevenv/domains/sections-apps.clipvaultz.online/public_html/20/bin/node
PassengerFriendlyErrorPages Off
